                <item>
                <title><![CDATA[【HD Live Performances】WEB-RiP - Sigrid - Live on Tape, Jugendfest 2.0-2.0, Alesund, Norway, 28-08-2020]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/sigrid-live-on-tape-jugendfest-2-0-2-0-alesund-norway-28-08-2020.292628/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					I captured both videos from internet: #1 (Home to You) from Jugendfest's Facebook and #2 from Vimeo. This is a special show performed by Sigrid in her hometown Alesund. Home to You, Level Up &amp; Basic are acoustic, the rest are performed with the full band. Highly recommended if you love great pop music!<br>
<br>
Setlist:<br>
01. Home to You<br>
02. Level Up<br>
----------------------------------------<br>
03. Sucker Punch<br>
04. Don't Kill My Vibe<br>
05. Never Mine<br>
06. Strangers<br>
07. Don't Feel Like Crying<br>
----------------------------------------<br>
08. Basic<br>
<br>
<img src="https://i.imgur.com/jaGuczv.jpeg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://i.imgur.com/jaGuczv.jpeg" style=""><br>
<br>




